
Property set operations.
USAGE:

SET <assign list>
NOTE: <assign list> can be more than one property name separated by commas.
Each property name should be followed by '=' and its value.

The following writeable properties are available:
Property				Type			Operation
========				====			=========
AutoReboot                         	boolean             	Read/Write
DebugFilePath                      	string              	Read/Write
DebugInfoType                      	uint32              	Read/Write
ExpandedDebugFilePath              	string              	Read/Write
ExpandedMiniDumpDirectory          	string              	Read/Write
KernelDumpOnly                     	boolean             	Read/Write
MiniDumpDirectory                  	string              	Read/Write
OverwriteExistingDebugFile         	boolean             	Read/Write
SendAdminAlert                     	boolean             	Read/Write
WriteDebugInfo                     	boolean             	Read/Write
WriteToSystemLog                   	boolean             	Read/Write

